## Required Verdict (machine-read)

End your response with a single fenced JSON object — and nothing after it — that
the runtime parses to decide convergence. It must be valid JSON of this shape:

{% raw %}
```json
{
  "status": "done | needs_more | blocked | unsafe",
  "reason": "one-sentence justification",
  "remaining": ["concrete unfinished item", "..."],
  "confidence": 0.0
}
```
{% endraw %}

- `status` — `done` if this bounded pass met the goal; `needs_more` if another
  admitted pass is warranted; `blocked` if external input is required; `unsafe`
  if continuing would violate policy.
- `remaining` — the concrete items still outstanding when `status` is
  `needs_more`; an empty list otherwise. They are carried into the next pass.
- `reason` — a short justification a human can read in the decision log.
